Microsoft Visual C++ runtime redistribution

App-local DLLs are copied from the installed Visual Studio VC/Redist/MSVC/x64/Microsoft.VC*.CRT directory. Microsoft retains ownership. Redistribution is subject to the installed Visual Studio license terms and the corresponding Microsoft redistributable-code list. The package manifest records each copied DLL hash. Debug CRT DLLs are development-only and are excluded from the Release distribution. Windows Universal CRT and the Direct3D driver remain operating-system prerequisites.
